1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,101
The evidence meeting was held at the base of the lab, on a table with four chairs and one broken foot.

2
00:00:06,101 --> 00:00:10,795
“This is not a talk about privacy,” Maya said.

3
00:00:10,795 --> 00:00:24,302
“It is a talk about proof.” The reply from the officer was short: a criterion was missing, and without a criterion the whole action could not be justified.

4
00:00:24,302 --> 00:00:36,809
The powerful part of the evidence was its basis: a currency of small permissions, a race to collect more, and an expansion of the storage that nobody had costed.

5
00:00:36,809 --> 00:00:48,187
A policeman, a brewer of beer, and a seller of alcohol had all signed the same form, and none of them could say what they had agreed to.

6
00:00:48,187 --> 00:01:01,109
The fragments were scattered down the corridor: a pie chart in the wrong folder, a legend on a map of the pine forest, a rod of aluminium in a stack of junk beside the bin.

7
00:01:01,109 --> 00:01:05,193
“We can formulate the rule now,” Lin said.

8
00:01:05,193 --> 00:01:09,063
“Nothing is collected on a maybe.”

9
00:01:09,063 --> 00:01:18,955
The correction came in two parts: a clarification of the purpose and a subtraction of everything that could not be multiplied by consent.

10
00:01:18,955 --> 00:01:25,274
“A surge of data is not the same as a proof of trust,” the officer said.

11
00:01:25,274 --> 00:01:29,703
“A warehouse of wares is not a service.”

12
00:01:29,703 --> 00:01:33,353
The invaders were not hackers but habits.

13
00:01:33,353 --> 00:01:44,820
An armament of small defaults, a preservative clause in the contract, and a singularity of purpose — to keep the launch on schedule — had to be equipped against.

14
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:48,549
“My game is simple,” Maya said.

15
00:01:48,549 --> 00:02:01,961
“Moderation is not a disable switch, and transparency is not alphabetic.” As far as the group was concerned, the third pass through the data was the only honest one.

16
00:02:01,961 --> 00:02:11,449
The cooperation between the hospital, the health office, and the lab had been off for an hour when the first correction arrived.

17
00:02:11,449 --> 00:02:18,738
“You cannot subtract a promise from a contract and call it a destination,” the officer said.

18
00:02:18,738 --> 00:02:34,027
A flame of temper, a quick pick of the wrong file, and a short run of bad decisions: the force of habit was the only invader left in the room, and it was the hardest one to expel.
